#op: cli
#args: data validate -l lineage.cue -v 3 data.json
A flag or argument is not valid, here a version that is not of the form
<major>.<minor>. The help says what the flag takes.
-- lineage.cue --
name: "ship"
schemas: {
	"0": {
		"0": {
			schema: {
				a: string
			}
		}
	}
}
-- data.json --
{"a": "Argo"}
-- out/json --
{
  "diagnostics": [
    {
      "code": "E0620",
      "severity": "error",
      "headline": "\"3\" is not a version",
      "help": [
        "a version is <major>.<minor>, such as 1.0"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "errors": 1,
    "warnings": 0,
    "notes": 0
  }
}
-- out/text --
error[E0620]: "3" is not a version
  |
  = help: a version is <major>.<minor>, such as 1.0
